• Optional account: Settings › Account & Sync. Sign in with an emailed link (no password) and your history, totals, streak and course progress follow you to every device. Devices list, Sign out (keeps your data) and Delete account are there too.
• Band noise now plays only while you practise, not on menus or Settings. Picking a level plays a short sample.
• Daily Dit Share sends just the card image, so Discord gets one post, not two.
• Buddy streaks: Invite and Share always respond, and say what's missing if pairing can't start yet.
• Fixed: Operating Procedure questions sometimes showed the previous question's answers (e.g. "Which control?" had no RIT).
Please try: sign in on two devices with the same email, finish a short session on one, tap Sync now on the other, and check the history matches. Then try Sign out, and Delete account on a test address. Also tap Leave on a buddy and check the confirmation appears.
